      "content": "Miriel is the context engine and platform for AI-native development. The API lets applications and agents learn from any data source and query relevant context in real time, with LLM-, vector-, and graph-based retrieval, per-token permissions (grant IDs), and encryption. This description is a faithful derivation of the official TypeScript SDK (@miriel/miriel v0.1.0); Miriel does not publish a machine-readable OpenAPI document at a public URL.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Miriel",
